,201.0 127.6,200.0 132.8,202.8 138.0,196.7 143.2,198.1 148.4,201.8 153.6,198.4 158.8,196.9 164.0,198.2 169.2,195.7 174.4,203.7 179.6,204.1 184.8,208.4 190.0,199.1 195.2,199.3 200.4,199.4 205.6,201.7 210.8,200.0 216.0,202.5 221.2,199.0 226.4,195.4 231.6,205.1 236.8,198.4 242.0,203.7 247.2,198.9 252.4,200.5 257.6,194.7 262.8,196.9 268.0,201.3 273.2,201.9 278.4,199.3 283.6,200.5 288.8,194.1 294.0,200.1 299.2,197.8 304.4,196.7 309.6,201.1 314.8,198.6 320.0,197.2 325.2,198.7 330.4,198.7 335.6,199.1 340.8,200.2 346.0,198.6 351.2,202.9 356.4,205.0 361.6,203.2 366.8,198.9 372.0,197.9 377.2,201.2 382.4,199.3 387.6,204.4 392.8,200.7 398.0,201.5 403.2,200.6 408.4,203.4 413.6,194.3 418.8,189.8 424.0,199.1 429.2,200.8 434.4,202.8 439.6,201.8 444.8,199.8 450.0,197.4 455.2,201.6 460.4,207.2 465.6,203.6 470.8,197.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#565656\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"398.0\" y1=\"194\" x2=\"398.0\" y2=\"206\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"434.4\" cy=\"200\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#b05a51\"/><polyline points=\"60.0,211.7 65.2,217.3 70.4,219.5 75.6,214.2 80.8,211.4 86.0,215.8 91.2,217.7 96.4,219.8 101.6,211.8 106.8,211.5 112.0,218.5 117.2,217.6 122.4,221.3 127.6,219.4 132.8,215.6 138.0,215.0 143.2,224.9 148.4,215.0 153.6,213.3 158.8,212.0 164.0,216.3 169.2,216.5 174.4,214.8 179.6,215.8 184.8,217.0 190.0,218.4 195.2,219.8 200.4,216.7 205.6,209.8 210.8,218.4 216.0,211.1 221.2,215.4 226.4,210.9 231.6,216.0 236.8,213.3 242.0,216.7 247.2,227.5 252.4,215.8 257.6,218.9 262.8,211.4 268.0,215.0 273.2,218.3 278.4,215.7 283.6,217.3 288.8,216.4 294.0,212.5 299.2,218.0 304.4,213.2 309.6,222.5 314.8,214.2 320.0,218.4 325.2,216.0 330.4,219.3 335.6,213.9 340.8,219.5 346.0,215.6 351.2,220.4 356.4,218.2 361.6,216.5 366.8,213.3 372.0,218.7 377.2,217.6 382.4,221.7 387.6,214.7 392.8,217.9 398.0,217.8 403.2,217.0 408.4,216.7 413.6,216.6 418.8,213.9 424.0,213.3 429.2,218.1 434.4,218.7 439.6,216.7 444.8,215.1 450.0,221.4 455.2,224.3 460.4,220.7 465.6,212.9 470.8,213.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#565656\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"421.4\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"421.4\" y2=\"222\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"374.6\" cy=\"216\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#b05a51\"/><text x=\"36.0\" y=\"44.0\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#505050\" text-anchor=\"start\">近</text><text x=\"36.0\" y=\"220.0\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#505050\" text-anchor=\"start\">远</text><text x=\"26.0\" y=\"132.0\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#505050\" text-anchor=\"start\">偏移距</text><text x=\"488.0\" y=\"62.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#b26a39\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"600\">近偏移距</text><text x=\"488.0\" y=\"78.0\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#b26a39\" text-anchor=\"start\">自动初值基本可用</text><text x=\"488.0\" y=\"184.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#b05a51\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"600\">远偏移距</text><text x=\"488.0\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#b05a51\" text-anchor=\"start\">信噪比低，误拾（红点）</text><text x=\"488.0\" y=\"232.0\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"start\">绿线 = 真实初至</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 1</b><span>一个炮集从近偏移距到远偏移距：近处的自动初值基本可用（橙点），远处信噪比低，自动初值偏离真实初至（红点），需要逐道人工修正。修正量集中在这些道上。</span></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "AI 能做什么",
          "html": "<p>把每一道看作一条时间序列，用序列模型或 U-Net 概率图<b>逐采样点输出&quot;已到达&quot;的概率</b>，取概率跃变的位置为初至；同时利用相邻道走时连续的规律做约束。</p><p>替换的是<b>逐道人工修正</b>这一步。处理员只需复核概率跃变不明显、或偏离走时曲线的道，并对整条测线的拾取做合理性检查。</p><p>本案例的可运行示范是序列模型的简化版：用窗口能量、前后能量比、邻道和背景能量特征加逻辑回归，逐采样点输出到达概率，与经典 STA/LTA 对照，并用 5 档噪声扫描观察低信噪比下的退化。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 620 132\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AI 介入点流程\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"26\" width=\"108\" height=\"72\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e6f1ec\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-opacity=\".28\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"26\" width=\"3\" height=\"72\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\"/><text x=\"21\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#212837\">炮集数据</text><text x=\"21\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#4c4c4c\">解编</text><text x=\"21\" y=\"83\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#4c4c4c\">滤波</text><text x=\"105\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\">01</text><path d=\"M119 62h9m-3.5-3.4 3.6 3.4-3.6 3.4\" stroke=\"#c9c2b0\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"133\" y=\"26\" width=\"108\" height=\"72\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f0f0f0\" stroke=\"#41699b\" stroke-opacity=\".28\"/><rect x=\"133\" y=\"26\" width=\"3\" height=\"72\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#41699b\"/><text x=\"146\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#212837\">窗口特征</text><text x=\"146\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#4c4c4c\">能量比</text><text x=\"146\" y=\"83\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#4c4c4c\">邻道一致</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#41699b\">02</text><path d=\"M244 62h9m-3.5-3.4 3.6 3.4-3.6 3.4\" stroke=\"#c9c2b0\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"258\" y=\"26\" width=\"108\" height=\"72\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#7e5a8d\" stroke-opacity=\".28\"/><rect x=\"258\" y=\"26\" width=\"3\" height=\"72\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#7e5a8d\"/><text x=\"271\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#212837\">到达概率</text><text x=\"271\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#4c4c4c\">序列模型</text><text x=\"271\" y=\"83\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#4c4c4c\">逐点概率</text><text x=\"355\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#7e5a8d\">03</text><path d=\"M369 62h9m-3.5-3.4 3.6 3.4-3.6 3.4\" stroke=\"#c9c2b0\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"383\" y=\"26\" width=\"108\" height=\"72\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f8ecdf\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-opacity=\".28\"/><rect x=\"383\" y=\"26\" width=\"3\" height=\"72\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#b26a39\"/><text x=\"396\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#212837\">拾取与约束</text><text x=\"396\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#4c4c4c\">概率跃变</text><text x=\"396\" y=\"83\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#4c4c4c\">走时平滑</text><text x=\"480\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#b26a39\">04</text><path d=\"M494 62h9m-3.5-3.4 3.6 3.4-3.6 3.4\" stroke=\"#c9c2b0\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"508\" y=\"26\" width=\"108\" height=\"72\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f1f1dd\" stroke=\"#767a2e\" stroke-opacity=\".28\"/><rect x=\"508\" y=\"26\" width=\"3\" height=\"72\" rx=\"1.5\" fill=\"#767a2e\"/><text x=\"521\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#212837\">拾取结果</text><text x=\"521\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#4c4c4c\">低置信度复核</text><text x=\"605\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"8.5\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#767a2e\">05</text><text x=\"8\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#505050\" letter-spacing=\"1\">ALGORITHM</text><text x=\"383\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#b26a39\" letter-spacing=\"1\">HUMAN CORE</text><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"366\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"187\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\">算法负责逐道给出到达概率</text><line x1=\"383\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"616\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"499\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#b26a39\">人负责约束与复核</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 2</b><span>从炮集到拾取结果的五步。第 4 步决定了单道的概率能不能变成一条物理上合理的走时曲线；复核只针对低置信度道，才能真正省下人力。</span></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "你需要准备什么",
          "html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">立项前先对着这张清单打勾。<b>勾不满不代表不能做</b>，但每一项空缺都会在后期变成返工。清单可点击，勾选状态只在本页有效。</p><div class=\"checklist\"><div class=\"cl-head\"><span>数据准备清单 · 5 项</span><span class=\"cl-prog\"><span id=\"cl-txt\">0 / 5</span><span class=\"cl-bar\"><i id=\"cl-fill\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"0\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">炮集原始记录</span><span class=\"cl-s\">单工区 10 万—100 万道</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">人工拾取 5%—10% 的道作标签</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"1\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">近地表高程与速度</span><span class=\"cl-s\">炮点、检波点坐标</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">无需标注</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"2\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">低信噪比道样本</span><span class=\"cl-s\">按信噪比分档</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">需重点标注</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"3\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">观测系统</span><span class=\"cl-s\">炮检坐标与偏移距</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">判断走时是否合理</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"4\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">相近地表条件的已拾取工区</span><span class=\"cl-s\">已完成处理的资料</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">用于预训练</span></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "技术难度与参考方向",
          "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:2px\"><span class=\"dtag\" data-d=\"中\">难度 中</span><span class=\"small muted\">数据量巨大、推理成本高；低信噪比道与强能量干扰（面波、折射）容易误拾。</span></div><div class=\"meter\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"\"></i></div><p>难度按三档标注：<b>低</b> = 数据现成、任务边界清晰、错了代价小；<b>中</b> = 需要一个月量级的标注与清洗，效果依赖后处理规则；<b>高</b> = 标签稀缺或安全约束硬，通常要先做小范围可行性验证再立项。</p><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">可借鉴的通用技术</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/method/ts\">波形回归<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/method/ts\">U-Net 概率图<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"#/method/ts\">强噪声鲁棒学习<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "案例：H 工区 120 万道三维资料的初至拾取",
      "lead": [
        "H 工区为黄土塬地表，三维采集 120 万道，远偏移距的信噪比很低。过去由 4 名处理员用两个月完成拾取。目标是**把拾取周期压到一周（含复核），90% 的道误差不超过 2 个采样点（4 ms）**。",
        "下面五步是这个案例的落地流程。注意第 1 步和第 2 步：它们不涉及模型本身，却决定了结果能不能用。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        [
          "地震道",
          "120 万"
        ],
        [
          "标注道",
          "6 万（5%）"
        ],
        [
          "采样间隔",
          "2 ms"
        ],
        [
          "低信噪比道",
          "约 30%"
        ],
        [
          "人工周期",
          "4 人 × 2 个月"
        ],
        [
          "辅助后周期",
          "1 周"
        ]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "分档抽样标注",
          "role": "工程环节",
          "do": "解编、滤波后按信噪比把道分成高、中、低三档，每档抽样人工拾取，**低信噪比档多抽**。",
          "effect": "标签覆盖最难的那部分道",
          "trap": "只标容易的道，模型在远偏移距照样失灵",
          "fig": "<img src=\"assets/steps/seis-firstbreak/s1.svg\" alt=\"分档抽样标注示意图\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"432\" height=\"205\">",
          "figcap": "左：一炮记录按信噪比分三档，远偏移距信噪比最低（红虚线为初至）；右：按道数均匀抽样时低信噪比档样本最少，改为多抽。"
        },
        {
          "name": "按炮划分训练 / 验证",
          "role": "工程环节",
          "do": "以炮为单位划分数据集，同一炮的道只出现在一个集合里。",
          "effect": "验证误差反映真实的泛化能力",
          "trap": "同一炮的相邻道几乎一样，随机划分会让验证误差虚低",
          "fig": "<img src=\"assets/steps/seis-firstbreak/s2.svg\" alt=\"按炮划分训练 / 验证示意图\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"432\" height=\"205\">",
          "figcap": "左：同一炮的相邻道初至几乎一样，不同炮之间差别大得多；右：同一个“照抄最近训练道”的模型，随机划分的验证误差明显偏低。"
        },
        {
          "name": "到达概率预测",
          "role": "算法核心",
          "do": "序列模型逐采样点输出\"已到达\"的概率，取概率跃变处为候选初至。",
          "effect": "每一道都有到达概率和置信度",
          "trap": "用一个固定阈值取初至，噪声尖峰仍会提前触发",
          "fig": "<img src=\"assets/steps/seis-firstbreak/s3.svg\" alt=\"到达概率预测示意图\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"432\" height=\"205\">",
          "figcap": "同一道记录：左边取“已到达”概率跃变处作为初至，误差只有几毫秒；右边用固定振幅阈值，噪声尖峰提前触发。"
        },
        {
          "name": "走时约束与回退",
          "role": "效果关键",
          "do": "沿偏移距检查拾取曲线，偏离邻道中位数过多的道用邻道回退，并打上标记。",
          "effect": "拾取曲线在物理上合理",
          "trap": "约束窗口太窄，会把真实的折射层变化当成离群点改掉",
          "fig": "<img src=\"assets/steps/seis-firstbreak/s4.svg\" alt=\"走时约束与回退示意图\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"432\" height=\"205\">",
          "figcap": "同一组拾取：容差合适时只回退真正的离群点；容差太窄时，真实的近地表变化也被当成离群点改掉（红圈）。"
        },
        {
          "name": "低置信度复核与回流",
          "role": "闭环",
          "do": "只复核概率跃变不明显的道和被回退的道；修正结果回流为标签。",
          "effect": "人工只看最可能出错的那一小部分",
          "trap": "全量复核，省下的人力又被吃回去",
          "fig": "<img src=\"assets/steps/seis-firstbreak/s5.svg\" alt=\"低置信度复核与回流示意图\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"432\" height=\"205\">",
          "figcap": "左：错误拾取几乎都落在低置信度一侧；右：只复核低置信度道和被回退的道，工作量约为全量的一成多，就能找回大部分错误。"
        }
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "title": "怎么算\"拾对了\"",
        "html": "<p>与人工拾取逐道比对，误差不超过 2 个采样点（4 ms）算命中。<b>按信噪比分档统计</b>——高信噪比道的命中率很容易好看，真正的考验在低信噪比档。漏拾的道不能算作零误差，要单独统计。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 620 186\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"初至拾取的评价方式\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"10\" width=\"192\" height=\"150\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fdfcf9\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" letter-spacing=\".8\">命中</text><polyline points=\"28.0,89.7 30.0,90.6 32.0,89.7 34.0,89.6 36.0,88.9 38.0,89.7 40.0,91.3 42.0,90.5 44.0,91.2 46.0,90.3 48.0,90.5 50.0,90.2 52.0,88.0 54.0,91.0 56.0,90.6 58.0,90.6 60.0,88.0 62.0,87.9 64.0,88.9 66.0,89.4 68.0,90.4 70.0,89.9 72.0,90.6 74.0,89.2 76.0,90.4 78.0,90.5 80.0,89.2 82.0,92.1 84.0,90.7 86.0,91.4 88.0,89.3 90.0,94.8 92.0,96.0 94.0,84.8 96.0,78.5 98.0,86.7 100.0,99.6 102.0,99.7 104.0,87.2 106.0,79.5 108.0,82.6 110.0,97.2 112.0,101.5 114.0,89.4 116.0,80.5 118.0,83.7 120.0,91.1 122.0,99.5 124.0,93.5 126.0,82.3 128.0,82.4 130.0,90.5 132.0,96.4 134.0,96.2 136.0,86.8 138.0,83.4 140.0,90.1 142.0,96.6 144.0,96.0 146.0,86.8 148.0,84.0 150.0,86.1 152.0,93.6 154.0,94.4 156.0,89.1 158.0,84.0 160.0,87.5 162.0,89.8 164.0,93.6 166.0,92.0 168.0,87.8 170.0,86.4 172.0,88.4 174.0,91.5 176.0,93.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#565656\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"88\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"88\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><rect x=\"84\" y=\"60\" width=\"8\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\".12\"/><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"56\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"124\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"88.0\" y=\"52.0\" font-size=\"8.5\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">真实初至 ±4 ms</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#454545\">误差 ≤ 2 个采样点</text><rect x=\"214\" y=\"10\" width=\"192\" height=\"150\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fdfcf9\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\"/><text x=\"226\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#b26a39\" letter-spacing=\".8\">误拾</text><polyline points=\"234.0,89.7 236.0,90.6 238.0,89.7 240.0,89.6 242.0,88.9 244.0,89.7 246.0,91.3 248.0,90.5 250.0,91.2 252.0,90.3 254.0,90.5 256.0,90.2 258.0,88.0 260.0,91.0 262.0,90.6 264.0,90.6 266.0,88.0 268.0,87.9 270.0,88.9 272.0,89.4 274.0,90.4 276.0,89.9 278.0,90.6 280.0,89.2 282.0,90.4 284.0,90.5 286.0,89.2 288.0,92.1 290.0,90.7 292.0,91.4 294.0,89.3 296.0,94.8 298.0,96.0 300.0,84.8 302.0,78.5 304.0,86.7 306.0,99.6 308.0,99.7 310.0,87.2 312.0,79.5 314.0,82.6 316.0,97.2 318.0,101.5 320.0,89.4 322.0,80.5 324.0,83.7 326.0,91.1 328.0,99.5 330.0,93.5 332.0,82.3 334.0,82.4 336.0,90.5 338.0,96.4 340.0,96.2 342.0,86.8 344.0,83.4 346.0,90.1 348.0,96.6 350.0,96.0 352.0,86.8 354.0,84.0 356.0,86.1 358.0,93.6 360.0,94.4 362.0,89.1 364.0,84.0 366.0,87.5 368.0,89.8 370.0,93.6 372.0,92.0 374.0,87.8 376.0,86.4 378.0,88.4 380.0,91.5 382.0,93.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#565656\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"294\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"294\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><rect x=\"290\" y=\"60\" width=\"8\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\".12\"/><line x1=\"268\" y1=\"56\" x2=\"268\" y2=\"124\" stroke=\"#b26a39\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"294.0\" y=\"52.0\" font-size=\"8.5\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">真实初至 ±4 ms</text><text x=\"226\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#454545\">噪声尖峰或面波提前触发</text><rect x=\"420\" y=\"10\" width=\"192\" height=\"150\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"#fdfcf9\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\"/><text x=\"432\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#b05a51\" letter-spacing=\".8\">漏拾</text><polyline points=\"440.0,89.2 442.0,91.6 444.0,89.3 446.0,89.0 448.0,87.0 450.0,89.3 452.0,93.6 454.0,91.4 456.0,93.3 458.0,90.8 460.0,91.3 462.0,90.6 464.0,84.7 466.0,92.7 468.0,91.6 470.0,91.6 472.0,84.6 474.0,84.4 476.0,87.2 478.0,88.5 480.0,91.0 482.0,89.9 484.0,91.7 486.0,87.9 488.0,91.0 490.0,91.3 492.0,87.9 494.0,95.5 496.0,91.8 498.0,93.8 500.0,88.0 502.0,89.1 504.0,90.5 506.0,88.4 508.0,88.9 510.0,89.9 512.0,91.1 514.0,89.7 516.0,87.8 518.0,90.9 520.0,85.8 522.0,92.5 524.0,94.1 526.0,85.5 528.0,87.8 530.0,92.2 532.0,84.4 534.0,91.4 536.0,90.6 538.0,85.7 540.0,89.5 542.0,89.9 544.0,87.3 546.0,93.9 548.0,91.1 550.0,91.1 552.0,94.2 554.0,92.7 556.0,91.9 558.0,85.4 560.0,90.3 562.0,87.3 564.0,89.6 566.0,87.4 568.0,87.0 570.0,87.0 572.0,93.1 574.0,84.1 576.0,86.7 578.0,91.2 580.0,93.6 582.0,90.8 584.0,84.1 586.0,83.1 588.0,91.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#565656\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"500\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/><rect x=\"496\" y=\"60\" width=\"8\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" opacity=\".12\"/><text x=\"500.0\" y=\"52.0\" font-size=\"8.5\" fill=\"#2f7d6b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">真实初至 ±4 ms</text><text x=\"432\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#454545\">弱信号道没有给出拾取</text></svg></div><div class=\"figcap\"><b>图 3</b><span>每一道的拾取只有三种结果：落在真实初至 ±4 ms 内（命中）、被噪声尖峰或面波提前触发（误拾）、弱信号道没有给出拾取（漏拾）。<b>误拾比漏拾更危险</b>——漏拾会被发现，误拾会悄悄进入静校正。</span></div><table class=\"dtable\"><thead><tr><th>指标</th><th>定义</th><th>验收目标</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>命中率（全部道）</td><td>误差 ≤ 4 ms 的道占比</td><td>≥ 90%</td></tr><tr><td>命中率（低信噪比档）</td><td>低信噪比道中误差 ≤ 4 ms 的比例</td><td>≥ 75%</td></tr><tr><td>漏拾率</td><td>没有给出拾取的道占比</td><td>≤ 2%</td></tr><tr><td>静校正残差</td><td>用拾取结果做静校正后的剩余时差</td><td>≤ 2 ms</td></tr></tbody></table><p>可运行示范中的指标由页面在合成数据上实时计算，用来理解方法的行为，不代表真实工区效果。</p>"
      },
      "fails": [
        {
          "name": "面波与折射干扰误拾",
          "why": "强能量的面波或折射波先于有效初至出现在某些道上，模型和传统方法都容易被提前触发。"
        },
        {
          "name": "低信噪比档缺标签",
          "why": "标注集中在好拾的道上，模型在最需要它的远偏移距道上反而没见过样本。"
        },
        {
          "name": "按道随机划分",
          "why": "同一炮的相邻道高度相似，随机划分让验证误差看起来很小，换一个工区就失灵。"
        },
        {
          "name": "约束过度回退",
          "why": "把真实的时间跳变（如低速带厚度突变）当成离群点改掉，需要保留人工标记的通道。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "demo": {
      "label": "可运行示范",
      "mode": "auto",
      "html": "demo/index.html",
      "intro": "这是一组程序合成的炮集记录，每一道的真实初至时间已知，所以能精确计算拾取误差；学习模型（能量比特征 + 逻辑回归）在 6 种噪声水平的合成记录上现场训练，并与经典 STA/LTA 对比。结果只用来说明方法原理和参数影响，不代表真实工区的效果。\n在合成炮集上调背景噪声与到达概率阈值，对比学习模型与 STA/LTA，并运行 5 档噪声扫描——对应流程第 3 步。",
      "height": 1080
    }
  }
